Z||000001||RossT||10-12-2000||06:02 AM||||I was going to do mine this past summer, but was able to polish out the imperfections,  but I did do research on how to do it.  Follow this link for help.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/002108.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/002108.html</A> <P>||||reg||1
